      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T15:43:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WARN_ON() will reboot a device only if panic_on_warn is enabled, right? I don\u0027t think we enable it in GKI.\n\nWARN_ON() is quite prevalent in upstream mm code. People even are talking about removing VM_BUG_ON()/VM_WARN_ON() because in production they are usually disabled.",
      "parentUuid": "28559ec8_adf26b05",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 215,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 215,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "59d573878b5a8d1d0839168fb3543281d2ee7cc5",
