        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 215,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-02T06:38:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some of the users of GKI kernels DO enable `panic_on_warn`, so please don\u0027t do this.  Properly handle the error, don\u0027t write code that will be guaranteed to generate a CVE eventually :)",
      "parentUuid": "10597a5f_df25d4e4",
      "range": {
